The bright-star catalog in this directory (`stars_wikidata.bin`) is derived from
Wikidata structured data, which is dedicated to the public domain under the
Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication:

  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

See README_stars.md for catalog contents and how to regenerate the file.
Attribution to Wikidata is appreciated but not required by CC0.
